{"reviews":[{"id":"B004Y00WIC-0","r":4.0,"t":"Smells nice, but not powerful","x":"Smells nice, but you really need a hot shower to get the scent into the steam. My shower sucks, but I could still smell it around me. Maybe I'll set it in a little cup or lid, instead of the shower floor to see if that helps.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-1","r":2.0,"t":"Meh...","x":"I wanted to like these, really. But they are nothing special. The scent is weaker than my bar soap. The &#34;energize&#34; scent smells exactly like a dose of &#34;Emergen-C&#34;, which made it less appealing. Will try to find something with a stronger scent.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-2","r":3.0,"t":"Nice for a few seconds","x":"Just used the second one....scent seems to fade real quick and all but one of the tablets were broken into small pieces.  I will probably not purchase again because of this fact.  The one that was whole dissolved in a matter of a minute or two.  Almost feel like I deodorized the drain!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-3","r":2.0,"t":"The tablets work great..","x":"The tablets work great...they are so refreshing.  I will purchase them from a different vendor next time because they arrived in a very mangled box with the corners of several of the tablets broken off and crumbling.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-4","r":3.0,"t":"Good scent. Bad design.","x":"I was looking for something to replace Sudacare Shower Soothers. These weren't bad. I liked the scent quite a bit. However I would say that they don't last long enough. They just dissolve too quickly.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-5","r":4.0,"t":"Fragrance short lasting","x":"Liked it a lot.  The only thing I didn't like was the aroma didn't last very long.  I was expecting to at least finish the shower but the aroma was long gone shortly after putting it in the shower","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Refreshing, pleasing scent!","x":"Just what I expected. Nice awakening scents. Just follow directions and don't leave tablet on bottom of shower floor near drain or it will dissolve too quickly.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-7","r":3.0,"t":"Okay....","x":"I really looked forward to receiving this.  Sadly, I was not thrilled.  The scent is pretty good - for the 15 sec it lasted.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2013"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-8","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth it at all","x":"Mild pleasant fragrance lasted maybe a minute or two in shower. Not in any way worth the money. Disappointing.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-9","r":4.0,"t":"Delightful, light smell","x":"I really enjoy shower tablets (who has time for that soaking bath??).  These have a delightful, almost orange dreamsicle smell.  It isn't as strong as I'd like--I've found others that really penetrate the air in the shower.  But the smell is nice (my kids enjoy it) and for the specific scent and at the low cost, I'd buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-10","r":3.0,"t":"Just ok.","x":"I like the scent when it comes out of the package--very bright and citrusy. But using them in the shower is another story. Found that I would have to use 2-3 tablets per shower to really get any of the scent to really be noticeable. Might buy again, but not totally sold on them yet. If they gave more per pack maybe.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-11","r":3.0,"t":"Smells Great but Doesn't Last Long","x":"These smell wonderful but just don't last very long. They're kind of pricey for something that lasts only 1 or 2 showers.  If it lasted a week or more I'd be more inclined to purchase again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-12","r":5.0,"t":"These smell amazing. They really do dissolve in your shower","x":"These smell amazing. They really do dissolve in your shower. I use them with a steam unit and a shower so they dissolve a lot and it is Paradise in there.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great way to start the day","x":"Love these. So uplifting and smells really nice. Per the box instructions, I made sure to not put the cube in direct line of the shower spray.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-14","r":5.0,"t":"These are great if you have a shower/tub combo and don't feel ...","x":"They do energize you as you shower. These are great if you have a shower/tub combo and don't feel like sanitizing the tub to take a bath!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-15","r":5.0,"t":"Orange you glad I like this?","x":"I like the citrus tablets. They smell great and make my bathroom smell very good. If you like citrus smell, this is for you!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-16","r":1.0,"t":"Nope!","x":"Put them on the ledge of my shower as recommended and all they did was crumble.  No aroma that I could detect.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Super","x":"I bought the Destress, the Breathe and these Energize spa shower tablets.  I will re-order again and again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-18","r":4.0,"t":"It smells so amazing in the morning","x":"I do wish these lasted longer in the shower. It smells so amazing in the morning. I love these.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-19","r":2.0,"t":"They were ok","x":"They were ok, not as strong smelling as a brand I used to buy and can no longer find.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-20","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"not worth the expense for the minute of scent you get when using these in the shower","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-21","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"It dissolves in like 20sec so it's really just a citrus smell for maybe 2min.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"First time to buy this scent but really enjoy it. Will definitely buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-23","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"I find snapping them in half and using half for a shower works well","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B004Y00WIC-24","r":1.0,"t":"Scent is too strong. Makes eyes water.","x":"So potent it makes your eyes water. Wouldn't purchase again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the scent pleasant and nice-smelling.","cites":[1,5,7,10,13,14]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the scent is weak or fades very quickly, often lasting only a minute or two.","cites":[2,3,5,6,8,9,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers received tablets that were broken or crumbled, often due to poor packaging.","cites":[3,4]},{"text":"Some reviewers feel the tablets dissolve too quickly, especially near the drain or direct shower spray.","cites":[3,5,7]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product overpriced or not worth the money given how briefly it lasts.","cites":[9,12]}]},"qa":[]}